	msgbox SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaPostBattle, MSGBOX_AUTOCLOSE
	end

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_EventScript_Daphne::
	trainerbattle_single TRAINER_DAPHNE, SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneIntro, SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneDefeat
	msgbox SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphnePostBattle, MSGBOX_AUTOCLOSE
	end

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaIntro:
	.string "让你看看我从馆主阿丹\n"
	.string "那里学到的超凡技巧！$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaDefeat:
	.string "阿丹，请原谅我……$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AndreaPostBattle:
	.string "看看把地砖全部踩碎\n"
	.string "会发生什么。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyIntro:
	.string "你大老远来了，可见不到\n"
	.string "阿丹。\p"
	.string "只要输给我，就见不到！$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyDefeat:
	.string "你很强！\n"
	.string "我被你可爱的外表骗了！$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_CrissyPostBattle:
	.string "你也许强得足以不被阿丹\n"
	.string "一招打垮。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneIntro:
	.string "看阿丹指挥对战的样子……\p"
	.string "那份美让我不由得\n"
	.string "成为训练家。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphneDefeat:
	.string "你打得比我更有\n"
	.string "美感……$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_DaphnePostBattle:
	.string "你在对战中展现的优雅\n"
	.string "真了不起。\p"
	.string "哦……我真幸运\n"
	.string "遇见了宝可梦。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieIntro:
	.string "我该教教你对战能\n"
	.string "有多残酷。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConnieDefeat:
	.string "哦。\n"
	.string "你很强。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_ConniePostBattle:
	.string "我告诉你个好消息。\p"
	.string "想走到阿丹那儿，你得把\n"
	.string "每块地砖都踩一次。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetIntro:
	.string "丰缘地区最高等级的\n"
	.string "宝可梦道馆……\p"
	.string "就是琉璃道馆。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetDefeat:
	.string "你的等级真高！$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BridgetPostBattle:
	.string "与其满足于待在强道馆里，\n"
	.string "我想去别的地方修行\l"
	.string "会让人更强。\l"
	.string "而且最重要的是，\l"
	.string "看起来更好玩。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaIntro:
	.string "我和阿丹一起训练\n"
	.string "宝可梦。\p"
	.string "别以为我好欺负。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaDefeat:
	.string "我被打败了……$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_OliviaPostBattle:
	.string "我觉得你有潜力。\n"
	.string "不如留下来\l"
	.string "和我们一起训练？$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyIntro:
	.string "优雅地滑过冰面，\n"
	.string "一条线都不压到……\p"
	.string "做出那种表演的训练家，\n"
	.string "一定优雅又美丽！$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyDefeat:
	.string "哎呀，你说什么？！$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_TiffanyPostBattle:
	.string "这很明显，但训练家\n"
	.string "强弱和年龄大小\l"
	.string "一点关系都没有。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyIntro:
	.string "和宝可梦在一起，时间\n"
	.string "一眨眼就过去了，\l"
	.string "喊一声“糟了”都来不及。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyDefeat:
	.string "糟了！$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BethanyPostBattle:
	.string "真希望我在喊出“糟了”\n"
	.string "之前，就能对\l"
	.string "没希望的事死心。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaIntro:
	.string "你想要的话，我可以\n"
	.string "用很稀有的宝可梦\l"
	.string "和你打。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaDefeat:
	.string "哎呀，好了！你好好看过\n"
	.string "我的宝可梦了吗？$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_AnnikaPostBattle:
	.string "我来这个道馆，是因为\n"
	.string "阿丹夸我的宝可梦\l"
	.string "可爱。\p"
	.string "哦，要是我在年轻点时\n"
	.string "就遇见阿丹就好了……$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaIntro:
	.string "嘻嘻……\n"
	.string "你严肃的样子真迷人。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaDefeat:
	.string "哦，天啊。\n"
	.string "我对你太手下留情了。$"

SootopolisCity_Gym_B1F_Text_BriannaPostBattle:
	.string "你肯定碰都碰不到\n"
	.string "阿丹。嘻嘻……$"


`
